      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i feel fine otherwise though. no headache, no arm numbness, i can speak perfectly normal and walk just fine. it really just feels like a localized nerve thing. if i dont have the other \"classic\" stroke signs, is it really that urgent? wouldnt it be better to just wait a day and see if the swelling goes down naturally before rushing to an expensive ER?",
